{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118111","id":3481537418,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7PhAuK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118111","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118111.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118111.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118111","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118111/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118111/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118111/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b9a0db2a6597a43fb0acee93e36a9ea010d86b21","number":118111,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix incorrect line reporting for mixed indentation errors","user":{"login":"vixxi77","id":149178230,"node_id":"U_kgDOCORHdg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149178230?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77","html_url":"https://github.com/vixxi77","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vixxi77/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #118004 \r\n\r\nTokenizer did append correct error data to the token, but the parser ignored the errors location and only forwarded the error message. As a result the reported line would come from the parsers current location rather than the location of the actual error.\r\n\r\nThis change adds a push_error(const GDScriptTokenizer::Token &p_token) overload function, without touching the old API, allowing for the full use of the error tokens data. \r\n\r\nAlso tested: \r\n- Mixed indentation inside functions, if blocks, and lambdas. \r\n- Standard parser errors still report correct locations.\r\n\r\n ## Steps to reproduce \r\n1. Create a new project and a script. \r\n3. Add this code to the script:\r\n```\r\ngdscript\r\nfunc foo() -> int:\r\n\tvar bar: int = 2 # Tab  <- Error shown here\r\n    return bar # 4 spaces   <- But should be here\r\n```\r\n## Screenshots \r\n\r\nBefore: \r\n<img width=\"1089\" height=\"295\" alt=\"2026-04-02-124313_1089x295_scrot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48963fc1-3eea-420c-862f-8921d415f7f4\" /> \r\n\r\nAfter: \r\n<img width=\"1084\" height=\"295\" alt=\"2026-04-02-123838_1084x295_scrot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db805064-82e1-431c-ae34-3d79d226c3e2\" /> \r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akie